        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">This group covers geomatic engineering.</skos:definition>
        <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">a) Geophysics and Geodesy are included in Group 3706 Geophysics.
b) Antennas for use in remote sensing are included in Group 4006 Communication engineering.</skos:scopeNote>
