    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">This group covers philosophy.</skos:definition>
    <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">a) Mathematical logic is included in Group 4904 Pure mathematics.
b) Political philosophy is included in Group 4408 Political science.
c) Applied ethics is included in Group 5001 Applied ethics.
d) History of philosophy and the history and philosophy of specific fields of study are included in Group 5002 History and philosophy of specific fields.</skos:scopeNote>
