        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">This group covers microbiology, including bacteriology, parasitology and virology.</skos:definition>
        <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">a) Microbial systematics, taxonomy and phylogeny are included in Group 3104 Evolutionary biology.
b) Veterinary microbiology is included in Group 3009 Veterinary sciences.
c) Medical and clinical microbiology are included in Division 32 Biomedical and Clinical Sciences.</skos:scopeNote>
